            "block_content": "Example 4 as shown in Figure H.8 shows Example 3 certificate structure but with the vehicle certificate chain cross signed by the OEM root CA certificate chain. This allows the SECC to validate the vehicle certificate using the OEM root CA certificate during TLS session setup. The SECC does not need V2G root CA certificate to validate the vehicle certificate.",
